& [RevalidationDecision]
  + both candidate identity families are byte-identical to the preserved 2026-08-23 inventory
  + PATH still resolves the npm wrapper first but ambient PATH is not selection authority
  + the active desktop task demonstrates use of the desktop product but does not by itself authorize Cantor to select the desktop resource binary as its B1 writer host
  + do not select by presence recency package version file size signer PATH precedence or assumed compatibility
  + exact generated request and response schema remains unbound because no candidate is selected and no schema-generation process was authorized

& [P3ToB1Join]
  + P3 evidence may become an upstream physical carrier-truth input to a later SWA-05 commission
  + P3 does not replace B1 immediate Phase3A revalidation executable environment sandbox carrier root recovery-owner or live-evidence requirements
  + B1 and P3 receipts are observations rather than runtime capability carriers and cannot launch B2

& [MaximumCurrentAction]
  + preserve this source revalidation input audit gap matrix narrative and publication
  + stop before canonical B1 lock signature code process launch filesystem observation schema generation root preparation or provider contact
  + request an explicit operator choice between the exact npm native candidate and exact desktop native candidate before closing G01

